From: Pine Drama Studio Authors <authors@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:35:26 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 28/32] pine(L2): test that Send to New Chat follows
 chat.sendToNewChat.enabled

The setting is registered on by default; with it off, the keybinding's when and the Send button's alternative do not
match a chat input with text.

diff --git a/src/vs/workbench/contrib/pine/test/browser/pineSendToNewChat.test.ts b/src/vs/workbench/contrib/pine/test/browser/pineSendToNewChat.test.ts
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..464f9438d22
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/vs/workbench/contrib/pine/test/browser/pineSendToNewChat.test.ts
@@ -0,0 +1,60 @@
+/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
